<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Delta Insurance '96 profit up 107 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Delta Insurance '96 profit up 107 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			(In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1996			  1995</p>
<p>    Gross premium Income  235.8	  vs	   215.1</p>
<p>    Net premium Income    127.3	  vs	   123.8</p>
<p>    Net claims		 36.6	  vs	    21.1</p>
<p>    Investment income	46.6	  vs	    20.5</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	 27.8	  vs	    13.4</p>
<p>    Dividend	    35 taka on 100- taka share vs 22 taka</p>
<p>(Note: Bangladesh Green Delta Insurance Company Limited, held its general meeting on Monday. The comapany, a general insurance company, said it made higher profit in the year due to maintaining high standard of professional services.)</p>
</text>
